1
00:00:00,746 --> 00:00:03,536
Yeah, I'm a freaking genius.

2
00:00:08,003 --> 00:00:09,923
(Penny:)Leonard, you are so great.

3
00:00:10,089 --> 00:00:12,089
(Penny:)Why can't all guys be like you?

4
00:00:13,050 --> 00:00:17,470
(Leonard:)Because if all guys were like me,
the human race couldn't survive.

5
00:00:21,392 --> 00:00:22,682
(Penny:)I should probably go.

6
00:00:23,060 --> 00:00:24,100
(Penny:)Probably.

7
00:00:33,529 --> 00:00:35,319
(Penny:)Thank you.

8
00:00:45,457 --> 00:00:47,997
(Leonard:)That's right, you saw what you saw.

9
00:00:49,962 --> 00:00:52,672
(Leonard:)That's how we roll in the Shire.

10
00:00:59,889 --> 00:01:01,019
[KNOCKING]

